  "releaseNotes": "v5.2.15 - GGUF header parsing read once instead of field by field: the \"parse\" stage of a warm model load falls 2.2s to 0.6s and a cached 1.83 GB load 4.5s to 2.8s (408 to 614 MB/s). Download segments are now sized by measured connection rate (~1.5s each, capped 16 MiB) so the progress bar and resume checkpoints stay useful on slow links without losing throughput. See CHANGELOG.md",
